# Bar Council of India Compliance Rules

## Content Rules
- Purpose: informational only, never advertising or solicitation
- Banned words: best, top, leading, expert, specialist, trust, free consultation, fees, offers, testimonials, results, client names, urgency CTAs
- CTAs must be neutral: "Contact", "Send an inquiry", "Message on WhatsApp"
- Use "advocate-client", never "attorney"
- No invented facts — unknown values go in src/data/site.ts as empty strings
- Lines with empty values are not rendered
- No visible "TODO" on the page
- No emoji or gavel/scales/pillar imagery

## Technical Stack
- Astro 7 + Tailwind 4 + Netlify Forms
- No React
- Use design-taste-frontend and full-output-enforcement skills
- Do not use vercel-react-best-practices
